uted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/94.html\">Sûre Ash-Sharh</a> › Âyet 8</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Ash-Sharh 94:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ve yalnızca Rabbine yönel.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل التحسب والرغبة إلى الله وحده.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/276</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالرغبة والتوكل والإنابة والحسب لله وحده<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 1/38</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s94a8\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/94-7.html\">Önceki âyet (94:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/94.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Sûre Ash-Sharh — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tefsiri: Sûre Ash-Sharh — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;in sözleriyle Kur&#x27;an&#x27;ın manaları\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/94.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https: